        },
        {
          "text": "Nikawaamuru wakati huo, nikawaambia, BWANA, Mungu wenu, amewapa ninyi nchi hii mwimiliki, basi vukeni ng’ambo wenye silaha mbele ya ndugu zenu, wana wa Israeli, nyote mlio mashujaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
