              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikamwamuru Yoshua wakati huo, nikamwambia, Macho yako yameona yote aliyowatenda BWANA, Mungu wenu, wale wafalme wawili, navyo ndivyo atakavyoutenda BWANA kila ufalme huko uvukiako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
